1
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:22,000
Never underestimate the danger of minor sins, for they accumulate over time.

2
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:30,000
A small sin repeated becomes a great burden upon the heart and the soul.

3
00:03:30,000 --> 00:04:08,800
Seek forgiveness often, and guard your tongue and your actions every single day.

4
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:20,000
This caption belongs to the second clip about sincerity in worship.
